{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49517","headline":"生查子 一 · 魏承班","name":"生查子 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟雨晚晴天，零落花无语。\n难话此时心，梁燕双来去。\n琴韵对薰风，有恨和情抚。\n肠断断弦频，泪滴黄金缕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏承班","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49517.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49517","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}